FLARE packages extensions to DiffuDETR for DIOR and VisDrone.

The DIOR and VisDrone source trees are separate archived implementations.
New top-level release tools rebind data/checkpoint/output paths and expose
the documented configurations. Detrex config resource symlinks were
materialized as ordinary files for portable archive extraction.

Upstream copyrights and licenses are retained in models/dior,
models/visdrone, their Detrex directories, and vendor/detectron2.
Dataset images and pretrained checkpoints have separate distribution terms.
